00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:05.550
To create a mail merge in Word for
Mac, there are some slight differences

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:07.470
than doing this in Word for Windows.

00:00:08.430 --> 00:00:11.730
As you can see, all of the tabs are
the same, and there's the mailing

00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:14.490
tab is there, which I can click
on, which will bring up the tools

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:15.960
required to create the mail merge.

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:19.599
I also have on the screen the letter
that I downloaded from the vision2learn

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:21.090
website to demonstrate with.

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:25.380
The first thing you need to do
when you're using Word for Mac to

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:28.380
create a mail merge is you have to
do each of the steps individually.

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:29.790
There's no mail merge wizard.

00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:33.170
There's no facility to insert
address block and greeting line.

00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:35.520
Each field has to be entered individually.

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:39.285
So the first thing to do is if I
click on start mail merge, you would

00:00:39.285 --> 00:00:42.705
select the type of document that you
want to create the mail merge with.

00:00:43.095 --> 00:00:45.195
So for this instance, it's a letter.

00:00:45.255 --> 00:00:46.395
So quite happy with that.

00:00:46.395 --> 00:00:47.115
So select letter.

00:00:47.805 --> 00:00:49.725
I then need to select the recipients.

00:00:50.235 --> 00:00:54.855
So selecting the recipient is basically
linking the letter with a data source

00:00:55.245 --> 00:00:59.145
and the names and addresses of the people
who I'm sending the letter to have been

00:00:59.145 --> 00:01:01.035
inserted into an Excel spreadsheet.

00:01:01.515 --> 00:01:04.724
So if I click on that and I'm going
to use an existing list, so I then

00:01:04.724 --> 00:01:10.664
need to navigate to where I have
saved the list of names and addresses.

00:01:11.104 --> 00:01:15.745
And, I know it is in simple mail merge
addresses, so I could click open.

00:01:16.005 --> 00:01:18.614
And again, this file I downloaded
from the vision2learn website.

00:01:19.935 --> 00:01:23.475
I will get a message up asking me
if I'm sure I want to open this as

00:01:23.475 --> 00:01:27.074
