am secure in the knowledge that this

00:01:27.074 --> 00:01:28.965
document is not corrupt in any way.

00:01:30.104 --> 00:01:31.065
I select Yes.

00:01:31.424 --> 00:01:35.294
And then it will open up a new dialog
box asking which sheet I want to take

00:01:35.294 --> 00:01:37.065
